cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Test Quest or its replication package, please cite this repository."

title: "Test Quest: IntelliJ IDEA Plugin and Thesis Replication Package"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Talgatkyzy
    given-names: Arailym

version: "0.1.11"
date-released: "2026-09-26"

repository-code: "https://github.com/sarzhomart/test-quest"
url: "https://github.com/sarzhomart/test-quest"

abstract: >
  Test Quest is an IntelliJ IDEA plugin for gamifying Selenium test
  improvement using contextual LLM-generated quests. This repository
  contains the plugin source code, documentation, and replication
  artifacts used in the experimental evaluation of the associated
  master's thesis.

keywords:
  - Selenium
  - test automation
  - gamification
  - IntelliJ IDEA
  - large language models
  - software testing
  - replication package
